        "A19": "Determinate-only comparison",
        "B19": "The row excluding UNCERTAIN claims estimates agreement where judges reach a definitive consensus; lower denominator must be disclosed."
      }
    },
    {
      "row": 20,
      "cells": {
        "A20": "Either-judge flag",
        "B20": "Union flag increases sensitivity but generally creates more false positive judgements."
      }
    },
    {
      "row": 21,
      "cells": {
        "A21": "Chance adjustment",
        "B21": "Kappa is prevalence-sensitive and claim observations within a response/task are not independent."
      }
